Package: chickpeaGenPred
Title: Chickpea Genomic Prediction Across Seasons and Locations
Version: 2.2.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Sujan", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible grouped cross-validation, leave-one-season-out and leave-one-location-out prediction, and marker-density sensitivity analyses for chickpea using public CicerSeq data.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
